    "summary": "As the opposing player's Movement phase starts, you can pick 1 enemy unit this model can see within 18\". Until the turn ends:\n\n- that unit's models have their Move characteristic halved\n- that unit's Advance and **Charge rolls** are halved\n\nIf the picked unit can **FLY**, then until your next Movement phase starts, roll 1 D6 each time it ends a move of any kind; on a 4+, it takes D3 **mortal wounds**.",
